                      (    forth6809.asm):03352         ; up. A found word is executed, or compiled when STATE is compile and
                      (    forth6809.asm):03353         ; it is not immediate. Anything else is converted as a single or
                      (    forth6809.asm):03354         ; double number (compiled as literals when compiling). An unknown word
                      (    forth6809.asm):03355         ; is typed and THROW -13 is raised.
