E610 3606             (    forth6809.asm):04681                     PSHU  D
E612 BDDCA1           (    forth6809.asm):04682                     JSR   CODECOMMA
E615 DC08             (    forth6809.asm):04683                     LDD   CODEHERE
E617 830002           (    forth6809.asm):04684                     SUBD  #2
E61A 3606             (    forth6809.asm):04685                     PSHU  D                 ; location; the parked dest is beneath
